{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/dev-ports.test.ts",
    "title": "开发端口选择的冲突与输入校验测试",
    "summary": "验证默认端口被占用时自动改选、显式端口冲突时明确失败，以及非法端口值被拒绝；测试还负责释放临时监听服务。",
    "category": "tests",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "purpose",
        "title": "解决的问题",
        "body": "开发环境需要避免前后端误连到已被其他进程占用的端口。测试先在本机回环地址建立临时监听，再把该随机端口作为默认值传给 `selectDevPort`，断言返回有效且不同的端口，覆盖“默认值允许自动迁移”的策略。[[c1]] 这一行为对应实现中捕获 `EADDRINUSE` 后以端口 0 请求系统分配空闲端口的分支。[[c2]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "boundaries",
        "title": "边界与未覆盖行为",
        "body": "同一占用端口若作为显式配置传入，测试要求抛出中文“已被占用”错误；非数字、负数、超过 65535 和小数则必须报 `invalid port`。[[c3]] `finally` 会关闭监听器，避免测试泄漏资源。材料未断言自动选择出的端口随后仍保持可用，也未覆盖非 `EADDRINUSE` 网络错误、IPv6 或并发进程在探测后抢占端口的竞态。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "默认端口冲突测试",
        "reason": "支持测试通过真实监听端口验证默认端口自动改选的论断。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/dev-ports.test.ts",
          "startLine": 5,
          "endLine": 12
        },
        "quote": "it(\"moves an occupied default, rejects an occupied override and invalid ports\", async () => {\n  const occupied = createServer();\n  await new Promise<void>((resolve) => occupied.listen(0, \"127.0.0.1\", resolve));\n  const port = (occupied.address() as { port: number }).port;\n  try {\n    const chosen = await selectDevPort("
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "开发端口选择实现",
        "reason": "解释默认端口冲突时递归请求系统分配端口的实现背景。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:scripts/dev-ports.ts",
          "startLine": 18,
          "endLine": 23
        },
        "quote": "  } catch (error) {\n    if ((error as NodeJS.ErrnoException).code !== \"EADDRINUSE\") throw error;\n    if (value !== undefined) throw new Error(`端口 ${port}（${label}）已被占用；请设置其他端口`);\n    const assigned = await selectDevPort(\"0\", fallback, label);\n    console.log(`${label}: 默认端口 ${port} 已占用，使用 ${assigned}`);\n    return assi"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "显式冲突与非法值断言",
        "reason": "支持显式占用端口和四类非法输入均被拒绝的边界说明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/tests/dev-ports.test.ts",
          "startLine": 13,
          "endLine": 16
        },
        "quote": "    await expect(selectDevPort(String(port), 4317, \"API\")).rejects.toThrow(\"已被占用\");\n    for (const bad of [\"oops\", \"-1\", \"65536\", \"1.5\"])\n      await expect(selectDevPort(bad, 4317, \"API\")).rejects.toThrow(\"invalid port\");\n  } finally { await new Promise<void>((resolve) => occupied.close(() => resolve())); }"
      }
    ],
    "questions": []
